        <mxCell id="tradeoff" value="TRADE-OFFS&#xa;1. Cross-shard queries need aggregation.&#xa;2. Rebalancing requires migration and routing updates." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
